Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:23:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] oledb32: rowpos enumerators, data source property store, UDL
 storage, DataLinks IDispatch, NUMERIC conversion

- IRowPosition connection points: EnumConnectionPoints and EnumConnections return real enumerators
- fallback data source (IDBInitialize/IDBProperties): property store, GetProperties/GetPropertyInfo/SetProperties,
  Initialize/Uninitialize state
- IDataInitialize: CreateDBInstanceEx, LoadStringFromStorage and WriteStringToStorage (UDL file format);
  the DataLinks object forwards its IDataInitialize methods to them
- IDataSourceLocator: IDispatch through the type library, PromptEdit
- DataConvert: DBTYPE_NUMERIC as source and destination, DB_E_DATAOVERFLOW / SIGNMISMATCH status rules
  taken from the conformance tests; todo_wine marks that now pass are removed
- GetConversionSize for more source types, class factory lock count, DllCanUnloadNow

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

